SignInTip#bilibili@apollo小黄,要想使用这个对话模组，请点击下面按钮跳转到 https://enter.pollinations.ai/sign-in页面内并注册,然后点击Keys→Add Key→设置一个喜欢的Name→预算和过期时间不填→Profile,Usage,Key Management,Models按钮全部选择→Create→复制API Key:|
SignInButton#点击跳转 https://enter.pollinations.ai/sign-in:|
ApiKeyLabel#API Key:|
ApiKeyPlaceholder#按照上方要求复制API Key输入:|
ModelsLabel#Models:|
ModelsLoading#加载中...:|
ModelsFailed#模型列表加载失败，点击重试:|
RolePromptLabel#角色设定:|
BalanceLabel#目前余额:|
BalanceLoading#查询中...:|
BalanceFailed#余额查询失败:|
BalanceResult#剩余 {0} 花粉:|
SaveButton#保存设置:|
SavedMessage#设置已保存:|
ErrorHttp#对话请求错误:|
ErrorUnknown#未知错误:|
Thinking#思考中...:|
